### 🎯 Goal

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Bidirectional Sync** | Data flows both ways (local ↔ server) |
| **Conflict Resolution** | Handle conflicts when same record modified in both places |
| **Incremental Sync** | Only sync changes, not full database |
| **Retry Logic** | Handle network failures gracefully |
| **Progress Tracking** | User sees sync status and progress |

