### 📋 Phase 2: Conflict Resolution

#### 2.1 Strategy: Last Write Wins (LWW) + Server Priority

```javascript
// src/main/services/SyncService.js – add conflict resolution

  /**
   * Resolve conflicts using Last Write Wins (LWW) with server priority
   */
  async resolveConflict(localRecord, serverRecord) {
    // If server has newer updatedAt, use server version
    if (new Date(serverRecord.updatedAt) > new Date(localRecord.updatedAt)) {
      return serverRecord;
    }
    
    // If local has newer updatedAt, push local version
    if (new Date(localRecord.updatedAt) > new Date(serverRecord.updatedAt)) {
      return localRecord;
    }
    
    // If same timestamp, server wins (for data integrity)
    return serverRecord;
  }
